  "title": "Auto Pickup Filter",
  "description": "Disable automatic collection of any item (vanilla or modded) with a single click.",
  "body": "<div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Auto_Picker_Filter/MP_AutoPickerFilter_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"900\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\">Tired of constantly picking up repetitive, annoying, or useless items while exploring, farming, or fighting? Auto Pickup Filter allows you to block the automatic collection of any item, whether from vanilla Minecraft or any mod.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\"><iframe style=\"display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/I2fb3ygoq4k\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></div><p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Auto_Picker_Filter/MP_AutoPickerFilter_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"230\"></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">🛠️ How to Use</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">Auto Pickup Filter is very easy to use and requires no menus or complex configuration.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">1 - Open your inventory&nbsp;<strong>or</strong> search for an item in <strong>JEI / REI</strong>.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">2 - Hover your mouse over the item you&nbsp;<strong>don’t want to be picked up automatically</strong>.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">3 - Press the&nbsp;<strong><code>I</code></strong> key.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">4 - From that moment on,&nbsp;<strong>the item will no longer be automatically picked up from the ground</strong>.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">To allow the item to be picked up again, simply&nbsp;<strong>press <code>I</code> again</strong> on the same item.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">⭐ Features</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">Enable or disable <strong>automatic item pickup</strong> with a single key.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">Works with <strong>any item</strong> (vanilla and modded).</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">Quick toggle using the <strong><code>I</code></strong> key.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">Fully <strong>compatible with JEI &amp; REI</strong>, including item lists and search results.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">Perfect for filtering repetitive or useless items (seeds, rotten flesh, feathers...)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">Greatly improves <strong>inventory management</strong> and overall quality of life.</span></li></ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">⚙️ Requirements</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">Architectury API (mandatory)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div><div><p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">